    "description_raw": "This spell functions like cure light wounds, except that it cures 4d8 points of damage +1 point per caster level (maximum +20).Mythic Cure Critical WoundsSource Mythic Adventures pg. 89\nThe damage cured increases to 8d8 points of damage + 2 points per caster level (maximum +40). The spell cures up to 4 points of ability damage if the target is a living creature. The target chooses what types of ability damage are cured.",
